msgstr "Values for the fields the process requires and the plugin does not fill in (a work item cannot be created without them). One per line: Reference.Name = value (every type) or Type: Reference.Name = value (that type only, e.g. Bug: Microsoft.VSTS.Common.Severity = 2 - High). Placeholders: {priority} (priority of the ticket as 1 = most urgent to 4 = lowest), {id}, {title}, {entity} (entity of the ticket), {category} (its category) and {requester} (its first requester). Lines starting with # are ignored."

